  "title": "Nordic Regional NWP Models",
  "description": "Cloud-native Icechunk/Zarr archive of hourly atmospheric analysis and forecast fields for the Nordic region and Arctic, combining output from the Danish HARMONIE model (2 km resolution, Greenland and Iceland) and the MetCoOp MEPS model (2.5 km resolution, broader Nordic region), built by retaining the first three forecast steps of each run to approximate an hourly analysis.",
